;
; How Cartulary files a version in its record hierarchy, in MYRA
; (cartulary_rules.h CR7): class, record, version, then the day it was
; filed (days since 1970) and the record's hold flag. The model asks
; whether the numbers fit before it writes the index line.
^ZXCART(cls:i4, record:i9, version:i4) = filed:i6! ^ hold:i1!
